Generic single-database configuration for Nineclaw Manager.

This directory contains Alembic migration scripts for the PostgreSQL database.

## Usage

### Generate a new migration
```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
```

### Apply migrations
```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

### Rollback one migration
```bash
alembic downgrade -1
```

### View current revision
```bash
alembic current
```

### View migration history
```bash
alembic history
```
